      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Evaluation of the SCAS in three groups of patients demonstrates high levels of test-retest reliability and satisfactory internal consistency. Multiple investigations of validity support the use of the SCAS as a measure of self care deficit which is related to social disability. The potential uses of the SCAS in clinical work and research are discussed."},
